OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer charged with
OL,4,Araping woman while on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer allegedly raped
OL,7,Fand strangled a woman while on duty,
OL,8,Faccording to the policing watchdog.
OL,10,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,11,FConduct (IOPC) said ex-constable Rikki
OL,12,FHall had been charged with two counts
OL,13,Fof rape and one count of non-fatal
OL,14,Fstrangulation.
OL,16,FThe 33-year-old is accused of attacking
OL,17,Fthe woman while on duty in Swansea city
OL,18,Fcentre in February 2024.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
