OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer charged with
OL,4,Araping woman while on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FHall, who resigned from South Wales
OL,7,FPolice during the IOPC investigation,
OL,8,Fhas also been charged with possession
OL,9,Fof a firearm and two counts of
OL,10,Fmisconduct in public office.
